MID_SE_Die_Set_C: <EDH>
MID_SE_Die_Set_C_001: *snore*
MID_SE_Die_Set_C_002: Are you... Are you asleep? While standing?
MID_SE_Die_Set_C_003: I was. Do you have a problem with that?
MID_SE_Die_Set_C_004: I am unimpressed. How can you possibly get quality\nsleep in such a position?
MID_SE_Die_Set_C_005: I get by. Go worry about someone else.
MID_SE_Die_Set_C_006: I'm used to falling asleep in my armor while I keep\nwatch over Orchel.
MID_SE_Die_Set_C_007: I see. Perhaps it is a familiar approach for you.
MID_SE_Die_Set_C_008: Is that all you came to say? Then I'm going back\nto my nap.
MID_SE_Die_Set_C_009: If you continue on in this manner, you will\neventually collapse.
MID_SE_Die_Set_C_010: Come on, then. Find yourself a bed for some\nproper rest.
MID_SE_Die_Set_C_011: No. My life belongs to Orchel.
MID_SE_Die_Set_C_012: I won't be sleeping peacefully until death takes me.
MID_SE_Die_Set_C_013: You talk about your own death so casually. Can't you\nsee that poor sleep begets poor performance?
MID_SE_Die_Set_C_014: If you don't get adequate rest, you won't be able to\nprotect the one for whom you care so deeply.
MID_SE_Die_Set_C_015: Recognizing your mistakes too late...after you've lost\nwhat matters...
MID_SE_Die_Set_C_016: It's not a problem. Nothing will stop me from\nprotecting Orchel to the end.
MID_SE_Die_Set_C_017: Don't be overly confident. Fatigue unchecked will\nbuild to a breaking point eventually.
MID_SE_Die_Set_C_018: You talk too much. I'm in Orchel's service. So I don't\ntake orders from you.
MID_SE_Die_Set_C_019: I am not making any orders. I am simply concerned\nfor you...
MID_SE_Die_Set_C_020: Don't bother. Alright, I'm done talking to you.
MID_SE_Die_Set_C_021: Diego, please don't shut me out.
MID_SE_Die_Set_C_022: *snore*
MID_SE_Die_Set_C_023: How stubborn... He should listen to his elders.
